sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    Client->>ObservabilityAPI: POST /v1/telemetry/log (Log Payload)
    ObservabilityAPI->>Auth: Validate JWT
    Auth-->>ObservabilityAPI: OK
    ObservabilityAPI->>LogProcessor: Scrub PII
    LogProcessor-->>ObservabilityAPI: Sanitized Log
    ObservabilityAPI->>Storage: Async emit to Loki
    ObservabilityAPI-->>Client: 202 Accepted
